## ▶️ How to Run

1. Clone this repository.
2. Open the **media-integrity-analyzer.html** file in any modern browser.
3. Choose your preferred theme.
4. Complete both interactive challenges.
5. Review your Media Integrity Dashboard.
6. Replay with new randomized scenarios.

